\subsection{Method \code{add_oco_order()}}{
Place an OCO Order

Places a new OCO (One-Cancels-Other) order on Binance. An OCO combines
a limit order and a stop-loss (or stop-loss-limit) order.
\subsection{API Endpoint}{

\verb{POST https://api.binance.com/api/v3/order/oco}
}

\subsection{Official Documentation}{

\href{https://developers.binance.com/docs/binance-spot-api-docs/rest-api/trading-endpoints#order-lists}{Binance New OCO}
